WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.000
Simulator: talk to the assistant like a real customer on Instagram, Telegram or WhatsApp; nothing is really sent.

2
00:00:09.546 --> 00:00:14.840
Under "Test customer", pick the app and language and send a message on the phone.

3
00:00:15.392 --> 00:00:24.140
Under "What the customer does", try other actions: a post comment, a story reply, an ad click or a voice message.

4
00:00:24.686 --> 00:00:30.560
Use "Fast-forward time" to see what reminders and follow-ups do after hours or days.

5
00:00:31.107 --> 00:00:40.240
Keep a correct conversation with "Save this conversation as a scenario"; after every change, click "Run all" to check nothing broke.

6
00:00:40.793 --> 00:00:46.590
For a clean start, click "Restart this customer"; real customers are untouched.
